{"3976340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cucina Stellata", "steam_appid": 3976340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step 1: Prepare the Kitchen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay out your instruments and cleanse your hands. Follow the recipe precisely as if it's a ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The body remembers what the mind has long since misplaced. The old prayers of blade and flame still linger on your finger tips. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The broth rises like incense. For now, you are still only a man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/04fea545effdb524fc320c2e28ab0a02.poster.avif?t=1777589941\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/04fea545effdb524fc320c2e28ab0a02.webm?t=1777589941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/04fea545effdb524fc320c2e28ab0a02.mp4?t=1777589941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step 2: Add One Uninvited Ingredient</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not part of the recipe. It does not belong to this world, nor any kitchen you have ever known.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flavor is...indescribable. Divine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot stop tasting. The sensation is beyond language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/f1b635f3394e152cb742ed063afa0702.poster.avif?t=1777589941\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/f1b635f3394e152cb742ed063afa0702.webm?t=1777589941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/f1b635f3394e152cb742ed063afa0702.mp4?t=1777589941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step 3: Adjust to Taste</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you consume, the deeper the hunger roots itself through marrow and vein.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your thoughts unfurl into cathedrals of blinding light and velvet void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each bite floods you with obsession, rewriting your pulse into a fevered hymn, a liturgy of devouring craving that knows no end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/15ed0bba57a4bd843e6e8da41f1bece6.poster.avif?t=1777589941\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/15ed0bba57a4bd843e6e8da41f1bece6.webm?t=1777589941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/15ed0bba57a4bd843e6e8da41f1bece6.mp4?t=1777589941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step 4: Serve and…Ascend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sleepless night. One sitting. One man. One irreparable act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fork trembles in your grasp as understanding blooms, terrible and radiant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are so ravenously hungry.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step 1: Prepare the Kitchen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay out your instruments and cleanse your hands. Follow the recipe precisely as if it's a ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The body remembers what the mind has